      "id": "legend",
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "left": 20,
      "top": 720,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Orange 3.3 V / red nominal 5 V / black common ground.\nGreen data / yellow clock; white reset / blue CS / violet DC / gray button.\nBrown raw signal / pink OUT/A0. Do not join the two positive rails.\nHeader ORDER follows references; body size and row spacing are illustrative.\nExplicit wires define connections; module insertion contacts are not modeled.\nReal build: soldered sockets, cable support, dry fit; no fixed cut lengths."
      }
